{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-auto-translate#feature-1","repo":"qwert702/dsh-auto-translate","commit":"3c7c019546f74f8e7e10e61c25d84ace1854ca3a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-translate 的功能「思考与回复翻译」：为英文思考块和回复文本请求中文译文，并在原内容旁显示。内容流式生成时会更新临时译文，结束后按完整文本翻译。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:222-286","lib/client.js:450-512"]}
