{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-auto-translate#feature-3","repo":"qwert702/dsh-auto-translate","commit":"3c7c019546f74f8e7e10e61c25d84ace1854ca3a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-translate 的功能「独立翻译请求」：服务端接收客户端提交的文本，使用配置的提供方和模型返回译文或摘要；请求正文受长度上限约束，失败时会尝试 deepseek-chat。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:175-219"]}
{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-auto-translate#feature-4","repo":"qwert702/dsh-auto-translate","commit":"3c7c019546f74f8e7e10e61c25d84ace1854ca3a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-translate 的功能「英文内容筛选」：客户端用文字比例和代码特征判断是否适合翻译，中文为主或代码占多数的文本会跳过自动翻译。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:117-143"]}
